        (
            name: "get-resource-metrics",
            description: Some("Retrieve Performance Insights metrics for a set of data sources over a time period. You can provide specific dimension groups and dimensions, and provide filtering criteria for each group. You must specify an aggregate function for each metric.  Each response element returns a maximum of 500 bytes. For larger elements, such as SQL statements, only the first 500 bytes are returned"),
