                    description: Some("An immutable identifier for a data source that is unique for an Amazon Web Services Region. Performance Insights gathers metrics from this data source. In the console, the identifier is shown as ResourceID. When you call DescribeDBInstances, the identifier is returned as DbiResourceId. To use a DB instance as a data source, specify its DbiResourceId value. For example, specify db-ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTU1VW2X"),
                    arguments: [
                        (
                            name: "string",
                        ),
                    ],
                ),
                (
                    names: [
                        "--metric-queries",
                    ],
                    description: Some("An array of one or more queries to perform. Each query must specify a Performance Insights metric and specify an aggregate function, and you can provide filtering criteria. You must append the aggregate function to the metric. For example, to find the average for the metric db.load you must use db.load.avg. Valid values for aggregate functions include .avg, .min, .max, and .sum"),
                    arguments: [
